@3000 = ~Bottle of Wine~

@3001 = ~A bottle of ordinary wine from a local merchant. It bears no special markings.~

@3002 = ~Felicity's Ring~

@3003 = ~Felicity's Ring

A finely fashioned gold ring decorated with delicate leaves. Its owner, Felicity, has been searching desperately for this keepsake somewhere in Athkatla's River District. It appears mundane, but its sentimental value is unmistakable.~

@3004 = ~Felicity's Ring

A finely fashioned gold ring decorated with delicate leaves. Felicity may be very happy to have it returned to her.~

