@3018 = ~Hannibal's Holy Symbol~

@3019 = ~Hannibal's Holy Symbol

This weathered holy symbol of Helm was once worn by Hannibal, the pirate who held the River District in fear. He served as a priest of the Watcher before renouncing his vows and taking a darker path, but he kept this token from his former life.

Though the symbol no longer reflects its owner's faith, its history may mean something to the priests of Helm. Senyan at the Watchful Shield may wish to see it as proof that Hannibal has been brought to justice.~

