@3024 = ~Ring of Magnetic Appeal~

@3025 = ~Ring of Magnetic Appeal

A rich nobleman once rose to power through formidable influence and shrewd negotiation, though his hideous appearance drove even his closest associates from his company. Desperate to be seen as charming rather than repulsive, he commissioned a mage to enchant a personal ring so that others would behold an idealised version of his face. He wore it until his death, after which the ring passed through collectors and pawnbrokers, eventually vanishing into the markets of Amn.

STATISTICS:
Charisma: Set to 18 while equipped
Weight: 0~

@3026 = ~An elegant old silver ring whose polished band seems to catch the eye even in dim light.~

