@3041 = ~Key to Hannibal's Base~

@3042 = ~A heavy brass key carried by Leslie, one of the dangerous wardens employed in the River District warehouses. It bears a shallow carving of a sea-serpent wrapped around an anchor. This may open an entrance to Hannibal's hideout once it has been discovered.~

