@3078 = ~Long Sword +2 'Khalid's Wrath'~

@3079 = ~This sword is not the weapon Khalid once carried. It is a memory of him, forged from grief and fear in a broken vision of Candlekeep. Its steel retains the familiar balance of a Long Sword +2, but its strikes leave an unnatural acidic sting.

