@3088 = ~Buckler of Seven Reflexes~

@3089 = ~Elenvar of the Silver Bough, an elven archer of the forest marches, survived seven battles in which his companions believed death had claimed him. On the seventh occasion, he knelt beneath a moonlit oak and offered his buckler to Selune, asking that his hands remain steady whenever he drew his bow to defend the innocent.

The Moonmaiden blessed the shield, and Elenvar carried it for decades through raids, sieges, and skirmishes along the woodland roads. He said the blessing did not make him fearless; rather, it gave him the swiftness to act before fear could take hold. The light buckler remains unusually comfortable to wear, and the blessing sharpens the bearer's natural reflexes.

STATISTICS:

Equipped abilities:
Dexterity: +1
Armor Class: +1
No protection against missile or piercing attacks

Weight: 2
Requires: 4 Strength~

